    "status": "present",
    "value": "Build a calendar that accepts events given as half-open intervals [startTime, endTime). An event may be added as long as no moment would end up covered by three events at once; double-booking is allowed, triple-booking is not. book(startTime, endTime) adds the event and returns true if this holds, otherwise returns false and leaves the calendar unchanged."
  },
